Package: tinyeval
Title: Evals for the AI Calls in Your R Code
Version: 0.11.0
Authors@R: person("evalship", email = "hello@evalship.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Bundles 'tinyeval', one bash script that runs test cases against
    the AI calls in your app and checks their replies. run() starts it, and
    worker() answers its test cases from your R code, loaded once.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://tinyeval.com, https://github.com/evalship-hq/tinyeval
BugReports: https://github.com/evalship-hq/tinyeval/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: bash (>= 3.2)
